gineering: Dave's fascination with auto engineering started at age ten after fixing an old car, leading to a lifelong interest in transforming broken-down cars to high-running ones. Calvin is also into cars and making powerful models.\n  - Dave: Dave previously enjoyed a card night and is restoring a car for his auto engineering goal. He chatted with Calvin about Calvin's amazing performance on a big stage.\n  - car: Dave posted on his blog about modifying his car; Calvin asked where Dave got the car after Calvin's party discussion.\n  - Dave (assistant): Dave opened his own car maintenance shop, teaming up with a local garage, and is enjoying sharing his car knowledge with awesome mechanics.\n  - car mod workshop: Dave attended a car mod workshop in San Francisco to learn about car restoration techniques and pursue his passion for auto engineering and custom car building.\n  - Dave: Dave asked Calvin about his car post-crash, mentioned arranging regular walks with friends in parks, and commented on a mansion's stunning view in Japan.\n  - something: Dave opened his own car maintenance shop, his dream, and Calvin congratulated him, praising his work for inspiring people.\n  - people working on your car: Dave asked Calvin about the people working on his car, inquiring if Calvin feels confident in their skills and knowledge.\n  - car modification: Dave told Calvin his car modification was a lot of work but worth it, after Calvin praised Dave's blog inspiring creativity.\n  - Dave: Dave's band had a fun rehearsal session last night. Last weekend, Dave attended a rock concert in Boston. Dave is also praised by Calvin for fixing cars.\n  - Dave: Dave attended a car workshop in San Francisco to learn car restoration techniques. He also had a card night with friends last Friday and discussed his ongoing car restoration project with Calvin.\n  - car maintenance shop: Dave's car maintenance shop lost a deal they pursued for months to a competing shop, making Dave feel bummed