rk feels like nothing after a competing shop secured a deal they sought for months, leading him to question if he is wasting his time.\n  - this journey: The journey is associated with Calvin's amazing summer drive, pondering life's intricacies, and an incredible trip to Japan. It reminds him of hard work and the path he has chosen.\n  - strategies: Dave asked Calvin for strategies Calvin uses to manage everything, following Calvin mentioning feeling overwhelmed by demands while touring with Frank Ocean.\n  - Dave: Dave greeted Calvin, mentioned taking up photography (scenery pics), complimented Calvin's gala appearance, and noted his camera captures moments clearly.\n  - Dave: Dave recently took up photography, focusing on scenery. He chatted with Calvin about a photo Calvin shared, congratulated him on an amazing-looking event, and acknowledged Calvin's plan to visit Boston.\n  - fame: Calvin, inspired by a friend attending his performance, reflected on how relationships and being around certain people spark feelings from when he and friends talked about getting famous as teenagers.\n  - team: Calvin mentioned his team is part of his strong support system that helps him manage his overwhelming job demands. He was also with his crew at a fancy gala in Boston.\n  - Dave: Dave enjoys photography, taking pictures of local scenery. He talked with Calvin about Calvin's inspiring chat with an artist at an event.\n  - opportunity: Calvin mentioned being greatly privileged to have been granted this opportunity, which he finds satisfying to bring back to life.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his album release and expressed enthusiasm for live music. Dave invited Calvin to see his cool cars in his garage.\n  - strum: Calvin mentioned that every 'mark and strum holds a story' about his performance on a big stage.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in