usic: Dave expressed that live music is the best and wished Calvin well on tour.\n  - Dave: Dave's band had a fun rehearsal session last night. Last weekend, Dave attended a rock concert in Boston. Dave is also praised by Calvin for fixing cars.\n  - Dave: Dave recently took up photography, focusing on scenery. He chatted with Calvin about a photo Calvin shared, congratulated him on an amazing-looking event, and acknowledged Calvin's plan to visit Boston.\n  - hobbies: Dave enjoys hobbies. Calvin relaxes by working on his Ferrari and converting a Japanese mansion into a recording studio, following his trip to Japan and meeting artists in Boston.\n  - music program: Calvin is supporting young musicians from a music program, finding their passion and enthusiasm inspiring.\n  - garage: Dave's garage is a little dirty but everything is in place; it's where he tinkers with cars, an activity he finds calming. Calvin looks forward to seeing it.\n  - music scene: Calvin toured with Frank Ocean, finding the Tokyo crowd insane. He is excited about the music scene and Dave will cheer him on in Boston.\n  - gigs: Calvin attended a music event/festival in Tokyo. Dave asked if Calvin had checked out Boston apart from the gigs.\n  - passion: Dave's passion involves car mods, which he shares on his new blog. He views car projects, like custom exhausts and performance upgrades, as therapy to calm down.\n  - favorite activities: Calvin recharges and gets motivated by taking a break to engage in his favorite activities when facing setbacks.\n  - Paradise Rock: Paradise Rock is a music spot in Boston that Dave mentioned Calvin should check out for great performances during his trip.\n  - Dave: Dave complimented Calvin's performance picture. He mentioned that Calvin's support for others keeps music going and passes on a legacy.\n  - Dave: Dave recently returned from a road trip with friends, enjoying the countryside and recharging. This trip reminded him of his passion, which makes long