elf-care.\n  - tricks: Andrew mentioned that teaching dogs tricks must be super fun and asked how often the walks take place.\n  - hiking buddies: Andrew hopes to take someone hiking, describing them as smart and loyal hiking buddies.\n  - explore: Andrew enjoyed rock climbing, calling it a fantastic experience and now plans to do more outdoor activities weekly. Audrey noted the need for exercise and exploration.\n  - park: Andrew has a picture of Audrey's dog at a park. Andrew's dogs previously liked sunny days at a park, and Andrew plans to take Scout, Toby, and Buddy to a park.\n  - hiking trip: Audrey remembers good times going on a hiking trip with her dog. The existing summary mentions Andrew had a great hike with friends and his girlfriend.\n  - open space to hike: Andrew found a new open space nearby to hike, which he finds refreshing.\n  - Toby: Toby is Andrew's pet who needs time to adjust to a new home environment with Scout and Buddy. Andrew plans to take Toby to a nearby park for fresh air.\n  - furry buddies: Andrew hopes Audrey and her furry buddies go on some fun adventures soon.\n  - dogs: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon; they looked cute, groomed, and had shiny coats. Andrew has two dogs, Toby and Buddy. They are considered family members.\n  - hike: Andrew suggested an epic, fun, dog-friendly hike soon with killer views; Audrey agreed and they need to pick a date.\n  - Andrew's GF: Andrew's GF, Toby, played board games with Andrew last Tuesday. Andrew's GF is mentioned in relation to a sweet sweater and possibly visiting a dog park.\n  - hiking: Audrey is looking forward to hiking with her dogs to see them happy, continuing a past bonding activity.\n  - Andrew: Andrew reacted positively to Audrey's groomed pets and is preparing a space for Scout, including a bed, toys, and puppy pads, for a slow introduction to Toby and Buddy.\n  - puppy: Andrew adopted a new puppy named Toby. Andrew shared photos of his puppy playing in the park, which made