n October 13, 2023, which implies planning to hike together.\n\nTherefore, the answer is three times.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Andrew and Audrey previously discussed going on a hike (implied by Audrey's lack of time to check out a hiking spot) (event_time: 2023-04-16T16:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey suggests joining Andrew for a hike (event_time: 2023-07-08T09:48:00Z)\n  - Audrey proposes that she and Andrew go for a hike. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey intends to go on a hike. (event_time: 2023-10-13T16:22:00Z)\n  - Audrey imagines Andrew and his pup conquering trails together (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew inquired if Audrey had previously taken her pets on a hiking trip. (event_time: 2023-06-02T11:27:00Z)\n  - Audrey plans to take dogs hiking. (event_time: 2023-07-08T09:48:00Z)\n  - Audrey requested that Andrew share details about his hike. (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - Audrey intends to find the best spot for the hike. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Audrey asked about the possibility of Andrew hiking with Toby someday. (event_time: 2023-09-06T19:49:00Z)\n  - Audrey asks Andrew how often Andrew is able to go hiking now. (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - Audrey's friends participated in a hike with her a few years prior to the current time. (event_time: None)\n  - Audrey participated in a hike with her friends a few years prior to the current time. (event_time: None)\n  - Andrew asked if Audrey often takes the pups on road trips. (event_time: 2023-05-06T10:47:00Z)\n  - Audrey hopes to find something nice for their hike (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew asks about how often Audrey takes them for walks. (event_time: 2023-09-24T17:53:00Z)\n  - Andrew plans to take both of them to the trails together soon. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew plans to take both of them to the trails together soon. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Audrey asks Andrew if the recent adventure encourages him to try more outdoor activities. (event_time: 2023-06-13T17:23:00Z)\n  - Audrey's pups are expected to participate in the hike (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Audrey is counting down the days until the hike. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking Audrey if her dogs enjoy going on hikes. (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - Audrey is growing together with the group (implied 'we'). (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew affirms that a future plan (implied hiking trip) will be an adventure. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Audrey went on a hike last year. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Andrew went on a hike with his girlfriend the previous weekend. (event_time: 2023-05-06T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey is asking Andrew about Scout's first adventure. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - The hike Audrey took was in nature. (event_time: 2023-04-26T00:00:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking Audrey how things are going. (event_time: 2023-09-24T17:53:00Z)\n  - Audrey frequently engages in something that serves as great bonding time, occurring multiple times a day. (event_time: 2023-09-24T17:53:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - hike: Andrew suggested an epic, fun, dog-friendly hike soon with killer views; Audrey agreed and they need to pick a date.\n  - hiking trip: Audrey remembers good times going on a hiking trip with her dog. The existing summary mentions Andrew had a great hike with friends and