h air, which Buddy seems to be enjoying as well.\n  - friends: Audrey meets with other dog owners weekly for tips and playdates for her four pups. Andrew values friends for support, and Audrey values friendship.\n  - picnic: Andrew has a picnic date planned with his girlfriend for Sunday, following an invitation to hang out on Saturday.\n  - puzzles: Audrey's four pups enjoy many activities, including puzzles, training, and hide-and-seek.\n  - bonding time: Audrey mentioned that petting, hugging, and walking her dog calmly multiple times a day is great exercise and bonding time.\n  - mountain life: Audrey recalls a special, peaceful moment by a gorgeous mountain lake with friends, characterized by the sound of birds, still water, and fresh air. She notes that regular grooming keeps her companions looking good.\n  - tails: Audrey organized a doggy playdate where the sight of many wagging tails brought joy to her.\n  - them: Audrey shared a picture from a playdate showing 'them' having fun together, which made her heart full. She takes care of 'them' (pups) seriously, keeping them healthy and happy with daily brushing and grooming.\n  - Andrew: Andrew reacted positively to Audrey's groomed pets and is preparing a space for Scout, including a bed, toys, and puppy pads, for a slow introduction to Toby and Buddy.\n  - vet: Audrey took her four dogs to the vet for a check-up, which was chaotic, leading her to plan future visits one dog at a time.\n  - types and flavors: Audrey noted there are many types and flavors of sushi to try, encouraging Andrew not to limit himself.\n  - all of them: Andrew is excited to see 'all of them' together and eating, referencing a pastry party.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1939,"context_chars":7524,"retrieval_duration":0.16007757186889648,"response_duration":2.0199670791625977,"total_duration":2.180044651031494,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer correctly states that Audrey and Andrew planned to hike together three times, which matches the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"INSUFFICIENT","completeness_reasoning":"The context does not provide any specific information regarding the number of times Audrey and Andrew planned to hike together. While there are multiple mentions of hiking plans and discussions, none of these indicate a specific count of planned hikes. Therefore, the critical information needed to answer the question is absent.","missing_elements":["number of times Audrey and Andrew planned to hike together"],"present_elements":["discussions about hiking","suggestions to hike together","intentions to hike","planning details for hikes"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_6","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_6_qa_22","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"Who or which organizations have been the beneficiaries of John's charity tournaments?","golden_answer":"animal shelter, homeless, children's hospital","hypothesis":"The beneficiaries of John's charity tournaments have included a children's hospital, as money was raised during the tournaments specifically for this cause. Additionally, John has been involved with a charitable foundation, creating software tools to help streamline their operations, indicating a broader commitment to supporting charitable organizations.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - The tournament mentioned is the one John organized (event_time: 2022-10-31T00:37:00Z)\n  - John is helping those in need. (event_time: 2022-05-08T00:45:00Z)\n  - John and his gaming pals raised money for the children's hospital through their gaming. (event_time: 2022-10-31T00:37:00Z)\n  - John participated in the tournament. (event_time: 2022-10-30T00:00:00Z)\n  - John held the gaming tournament with his friends. (event_time: 2022-10-30T00:00:00Z)\n  - John's activities help the community, including charity. (event_time: 2022-05-08T00:45:00Z)\n  - John organized the online gaming tournament. (event_time: 2022-05-08T00:45:00Z)\n  - John took part in a tournament at the gaming convention. (event_time: 2022-03-27T00:40:00Z)\n  - John is considering organizing more events like the tournament in the future. (event_time: 2022-05-08T00:45:00Z)\n  - John felt that seeing everyone come together for charity was rewarding. (event_time: 2022-05-08T00:45:00Z)\n  - Siblings provide support to John, which means everything to him. (event_time: 2022-07-22T09:49:00Z)\n  - John was inspired by the passion of the charitable foundation for helping kids. (event_time: 2022-05-11T17:00:00Z)\n  - John cooked food which was given to the homeless (event_time: 2022-05-08T00:45:00Z)\n  - John received money for placing second in the tournament. (event_time: 2022-05-23T19:33:00Z)\n  - John entered a local tournament (event_time: 2022-05-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Money was raised during the tournament for a children's hospital. (event_time: 2022-10-30T00:00:00Z)\n  - John (assistant) is looking for non-profit organizations that align with his values and passion for programming. (event_time: 2022-05-11T17:00:00Z)\n  - The online gaming tournament raised money for charity. (event_time: 2022-05-07T00:45:00Z)\n  - John felt that combining gaming with a good cause like a children's hospital felt awesome. (event_time: 2022-10-30T00:00:00Z)\n  - John intends to become an organizer of tournaments for various computer games in the state. (event_time: 2022-08-06T13:45:00Z)\n  - John has been looking into volunteering. (event_time: 2022-06-19T21:59:00Z)\n  - James mentions the tournamen