; both were inspiring events.\n  - community: Deborah and neighbor ran a free gardening class for the community yesterday; people of any age joined. Community was also focus of Deborah's prior yoga/cleanup and Jolene's renewable energy project.\n  - events: Deborah and her neighbor ran a free gardening class for the community yesterday, which was well-attended by people of all ages.\n  - neighbor: Deborah's neighbor co-ran a free community gardening class with Deborah yesterday. The class was attended by people of any age.\n  - activities: Deborah told Anna the story of her life last Friday. Deborah focuses on teaching yoga and organizing a yoga event last month. Jolene asked about maintaining balance between hobbies and studies.\n  - yoga class: Deborah bought new props and a candle for her yoga class, which she enjoys teaching as it transforms neighbors and builds community connections.\n  - yoga event: Deborah organized a yoga event last month, which she enjoyed and found cool. Jolene later asked for details on how it was put together.\n  - Deb: Deborah (Deb) ran a free community gardening class yesterday with her neighbor, which was enjoyed by people of any age.\n  - company: Deborah started a project for a cleanup in the community and is raising funds for it.\n  - supportive community: Deborah noted that having a supportive community helps motivate and encourage each other. Jolene appreciated Deborah's support.\n  - Deborah: Deborah enjoyed a music festival, feeling music unites people. She recalls her mother's soothing lullabies and complimented Jolene's tranquil trip photo, highlighting that trips create shared memories.\n  - yoga retreat: Jolene attended an awesome yoga retreat described as peaceful with amazing sunrise views, making attendees feel alive and grateful. Deborah inquires about a future experience.\n  - Deborah's dad: Deborah's dad passed away suddenly two days ago. Deborah is channeling grief by spending time with family and looking at memories, including her parents' 1993 wedding photos.\n  - being outside: Jolene likes being outside because it is calming and refreshing, and asked Deborah if she has any special spots she likes to go to.\n  - hobbies: Jolene is seeking tips for balancing hobbies and studies; Deborah focuses on teaching yoga and organizing a yoga event last month.\n  - Moments: Deborah cherishes moments that evoke nostalgia, longing, and gratitude for memories, mentioning she brought flowers to a meaningful place.\n  - neighborhood: Deborah started a yoga class in the neighborhood, which she shares with neighbors to help transform them.\n  - stories about Deborah's mom: Deborah reconnected with her mom's old friends, and hearing stories about her mom was emotional, bringing a mix of happy and sad feelings, but overall comforting.\n  - Deborah's parents: Deborah's parents got married in 1993, as seen in a family wedding photo.\n  - our time together: Deborah finds comfort in remembering 'our time together' with a friend who passed away last week, finding peace in her garden.\n  - last summer: Karlie and Deborah had a great time hiking last summer, which is when their last photo was taken.\n  - Deborah's mum: Deborah's mum was her biggest fan and source of motivation, often attending Deborah's yoga classes with her.\n  - a place to chill: Deborah mentioned a favorite spot to ponder, let things go, and chill, describing it as a cozy nook.\n  - creation: Deborah mentioned a creation to Jolene, relating it to someone special's grace and strength when facing hardships.\n  - Deborah's mother: Deborah's mother enjoyed reading and believed art could give strong emotions and uniquely connect people. Deborah feels close to her mother when visiting art shows.\n  - spot: Deborah considers this spot a favorite place to ponder and let things go. Jolene meditates near this tranquil spot, which is associated with Deborah's memories of her mom's house.\n  - walks: Deborah suggested taking walks as a helpful self-care activity for finding work-life balance. Jolene mentioned Deborah takes photos during her walks.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1954,"context_chars":8040,"retrieval_duration":0.2557501792907715,"response_duration":1.4441580772399902,"total_duration":1.6999082565307617,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer specifies a date in September 2023, which is not within the last week of August 2023 as indicated in the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides specific information about Deborah attending a community meetup last Friday, which corresponds to the last week of August 2023. This directly answers the question regarding when Deborah went to a community meetup, aligning perfectly with the golden answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Deborah attended a community meetup last Friday.","The date of the meetup is within the last week of August 2023."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_0","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_0_qa_35","category":"2","difficulty":"unknown","query":"When did Melanie go camping in July?","golden_answer":"two weekends before 17 July 2023","hypothesis":"Melanie went camping in July on two occasions: \n\n1. On July 3, 2023, when she spent time with her kids during a camping trip.\n2. On July 15, 2023, when she went on another camping trip with her family.\n\nTherefore, the specific dates when Melanie went camping in July are July 3, 2023, and July 15, 2023.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Melanie recently went camping with the kids a few weeks ago. (event_time: 2023-08-23T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie remembers a camping trip with others that occurred last year. (event_time: 2022-07-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie is thinking about going camping next month. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Melanie unplugged and spent time with her kids during the camping trip two weekends ago. (event_time: 2023-07-03T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie participated in camping with her family two weekends ago. (event_time: 2023-07-03T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie had a quiet weekend after going camping with her family two weekends prior to the current message. (event_time: 2023-07-03T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie went on another camping trip. (event_time: 2023-07-15T13:51:00Z)\n  - Melanie participated in camping (event_time: 2023-06-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie remembers observing the Perseid meteor shower during the camping trip last year. (event_time: 2022-07-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie recently went to the beach. (event_time: 2023-07-20T20:56:00Z)\n  - Melanie went on a hike. (event_time: 2023-06-27T10:37:00Z)\n  - Melanie went camping with the kids. (event_time: 2023-08-23T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie took her family camping in the mountains (event_time: 2023-06-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie's kids accompanied her when she went camping with her family two weekends ago. (event_time: 2023-07-03T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie and the kids had a blast exploring the forest while camping. (event_time: 2023-08-23T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie enjoys camping trips with her family. (event_time: 2023-10-20T18:55:00Z)\n  - Melanie wants to do a family outing this summer (event_time: 2023-08-17T13:50:00Z)\n  - Melanie's family went on another camping trip. (event_time: 2023-07-15T13:51:00Z)\n  - Melanie enjoys exploring forests. (event_time: 2023-07-15T13:51:00Z)\n  - The family camping trip is the highlight of Melanie's summer. (event_time: 2023-07-20T20:56:00Z)\n  - Melanie's camping trips are taken with her family (fam). (event_time: 2023-10-20T18:55:00Z)\n  - Melanie gets to spend quality, tranquil time with her family waking up to nature (event_time: 2023-10-20T18:55:00Z)\n  - Melanie looks forward to the family camping trip. (event_time: 2023-07-20T20:56:00Z)\n  - Hiking in the mountains is a way for Melanie to connect with nature. (event_time: 2023-07-15T13:51:00Z)\n  - Caroline is asking what Melanie loves most about camping with her family. (event_time: 2023-10-20T18:55:00Z)\n  - The camping trip took place in the forest. (event_time: 2023-07-15T13:51:00Z)\n  - The camping trip took place in the mountains (event_time: 2023-06-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Melanie's family's camping takes place at the beach. (event_time: 2023-07-06T20:18:00Z)\n  - Melanie bonds over campfires during their time together. (event_time: 2023-10-20T18:55:00Z)\n  - The camping trip included hiking. (event_time: 2023-08-23T00:00:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - camping: Melanie went camping with her family recently, enjoying exploring the forest and hiking. She also mentioned her son was in an accident during a recent road trip.\n  - forest: Melanie and her family went camping a few weeks ago, exploring the forest and hiking, finding it refreshing for the soul.\n  - summer break: Melanie's kids are excited about the upcoming summer break, and the family is considering a camping trip next month.\n  - mountains: Melanie took her family camping in the mountains last week for a nice time together.\n  - family camping trip: Melanie looks forward to the annual family camping trip, which involves roasting marshmallows and telling stories around the campfire, as a summer highlight.\n  - camping trip: Melanie loves camping trips with her family because nature brings peace and serenity. She previously recalled a trip where they watched the Perseid meteor shower.\n  - stories: Melanie bonded over stories during a peaceful camping trip with family, which refreshed her soul.\n  - camping memory: Caroline asked Melanie about her best camping memory.\n  - fresh air: Melanie finds waking up to the smell of fresh air during camping to be peaceful and soul-refreshing.\n  - Melanie's family: Melanie's son was in an accident during a recent road trip, causing a scary experience, but he is okay. The family previously enjoyed clay creations and a camping trip.\n  - campfire: Melanie enjoyed sharing stories around the campfire with family during a peaceful camping trip that refreshed her soul.\n  - beach trips: Caroline mentioned that Melanie has special traditions involving beach trips and asked about other summer traditions they share.\n  - exploring forests: Melanie and her family enjoy exploring forests as a way to connect with nature and each other, alongside hiking in the mountains.\n  - kids: Melanie's son was in a scary road trip accident but is now okay. Melanie mentioned her kids enjoyed an activity they did yesterday to relax after the trip. Caroline is passionate about helping kids through adoption.\n  - trip: Melanie experienced a scary roadtrip where her son was in an accident, but he was okay. Caroline expressed relief and discussed the importance of family.\n  - Melanie's son: Melanie's son was in an accident during a road trip, which was a scary experience, but he was thankfully okay.\n  - journey: Caroline discussed her transgender journey, which started three years ago and involved volunteering at an LGBTQ+ youth center to support young people. Melanie praised her progress and authenticity.\n  - summer: The family camping trip is the highlight of the summer, involving roasting marshmallows and telling stories around the campfire.\n  - moments: Melanie stated that playing games, eating good food, and hanging out constitute awesome family moments. She is glad Caroline is there to share in these special moments.\n  - Mel: Melanie (Mel) congratulated Caroline on passing adoption agency interviews. She supports Caroline's goal of building a family through adoption to help needy kids.\n  - Melanie: Melanie congratulated Caroline on passing adoption agency interviews, viewing adoption as a loving way to build a family for needy kids, and encouraged Caroline to be herself.\n  - Melanie's daughter: Melanie celebrated her daughter's birthday last night with a concert. Melanie mentioned seeing her daughter's smiles was awesome.\n  - next time: Melanie asked Caroline what she hopes to do for the next time, following Caroline's volunteering experience.\n  - Melanie (assistant): Melanie enjoyed pottery class yesterday, finding it relaxing and creative. She also complimented Caroline's artwork, noting it captured a peaceful sunset.\n  - running: Melanie runs farther to de-stress and improve her headspace. She previously ran a charity race for mental health. Caroline encouraged Melanie's running activity.\n  - new chapter: Melanie is excited for the 'new chapter', stating that her family will receive love and stability.\n  - Caroline's Web: Melanie read \"Charlotte's Web\" as a child and appreciated how it showed the impact of friendship and compassion.\n  - universe: Melanie felt tiny and in awe of the universe, which reminded her of how awesome life is due to many little moments.\n  - self-care: Melanie ran a charity race for mental health and realized self-care is important; Caroline supports Melanie prioritizing self-care as vital for her well-being and family.\n  - paintings: Caroline is preparing to show her paintings at an LGBTQ art show next month. She mentioned this when asking Melanie about creative outlets.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1960,"context_chars":8063,"retrieval_duration":0.1515953540802002,"response_duration":3.07948637008667,"total_duration":3.23108172416687,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer provides specific dates for when Melanie went camping in July, which aligns with the gold answer's reference to camping two weekends before July 17, 2023.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides specific information about Melanie's camping trips in July, including the fact that she went camping two weekends before July 17, 2023, which aligns perfectly with the golden answer. The relevant facts indicate that she went camping on July 3, 2023, and again on July 15, 2023, confirming the timing of her trips. Therefore, all necessary details to answer the question are present.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Melanie went camping two weekends before 17 July 2023 (July 3, 2023)","Melanie went camping again on July 15, 2023"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_8","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_8_qa_103","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What kind of recipe did Evan request from Sam on 19 August, 2023?","golden_answer":"recipes with more vegetables","hypothesis":"On August 19, 2023, Evan expressed a desire to have a recipe from Sam. Specifically, he asked Sam if he has any favorite recipes to share.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Evan asks Sam for suggestions for healthy recipes (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Sam offers to share a tasty and easy roasted veg recipe with Evan. (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Sam has recipes, which Evan is asking about. (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sam if Sam has any favorite recipes to share. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Sam is asking Evan about tonight's dinner. (event_time: 2024-01-06T13:32:00Z)\n  - Evan asks Sam how the cooking class is going. (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Evan expressed eagerness to hear updates from Sam regarding how things are going. (event_time: 2023-05-24T19:11:00Z)\n  - Evan is asking Sam what sets off Cravings for Sam. (event_time: 2023-09-11T09:28:00Z)\n  - Evan intends to send the recipes to Sam (event_time: 2023-12-31T11:00:00Z)\n  - Evan expresses a desire to have the recipe. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Sam asks Evan for suggestions regarding healthier snack ideas. (event_time: 2023-12-31T11:00:00Z)\n  - Evan asks Sam if he has acquired any yummy new meals from the cooking class. (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Evan greeted Sam and asked what was up. (event_time: 2023-12-17T18:48:00Z)\n  - Sam can share more recipes from the cooking class with Evan (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Sam provided the recipe. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sam what Evan has been doing during the past few weeks. (event_time: 2023-09-11T09:28:00Z)\n  - Sam acknowledges a suggestion from Evan. (event_time: 2023-08-13T16:09:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sam if he has made any recent dietary changes. (event_time: 2023-06-06T15:55:00Z)\n  - The recipe Evan discovered is for energy balls. (event_time: 2023-12-31T11:00:00Z)\n  - Evan is thankful for the recipe that was shared. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Sam asked Evan if Evan made 'that'. (event_time: 2024-01-06T13:32:00Z)\n  - Sam asked Evan how Evan decides what to paint for the paintings. (event_time: 2023-10-06T20:57:00Z)\n  - Evan finds something (implied to be Sam's grilled dish) delicious (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Sam asked Evan how Evan was doing. (event_time: 2024-01-10T00:17:00Z)\n  - Sam offered the recipe for the homemade sauce to someone else. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Sam asked Evan about the novel. (event_time: 2023-07-27T10:52:00Z)\n  - Sam thinks Evan's idea about the salad from a restaurant is smart. (event_time: 2024-01-10T00:17:00Z)\n  - Evan asks Sam to keep him updated. (event_time: 2023-05-24T19:11:00Z)\n  - Sam inquired about what news Evan has since their last meeting. (event_time: 2023-05-18T13:47:00Z)\n  - Evan inquired about what hobbies Sam has found. (event_time: 2023-05-18T13:47:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - roasted veg recipe: Sam plans to share a tasty and easy roasted veg recipe with Evan.\n  - tonight's dinner: Sam asked Evan what was cooking for tonight's dinner.\n  - recipe: Evan discovered a cool recipe for energy balls while trying to eat healthier, similar to Sam's lifestyle focus.\n  - Evan: Evan congratulated Sam on becoming a Weight Watchers coach, finding it exciting and rewarding.\n  - Evan: Evan congratulated Sam on becoming a Weight Watchers coach and expressed excitement for Sam's health journey.\n  - Sam: Sam greeted Evan, congratulated him, asked about a woman from Canada, and jokingly suggested putting a GPS sensor on Evan's keys.\n  - Sam: Sam congratulated Evan on sharing marriage news with family and wished them an incredible honeymoon filled with skiing, local dishes, and breathtaking views.\n  - Sam: Sam greeted Evan, mentioned starting to eat healthier, and expressed sympathy regarding Evan's knee injury, asking about ways to stay active during healing.\n  - Evan: Evan's son hurt his ankle in a soccer accident last Saturday, requiring doctor visits. He expressed interest in healthy recipes Sam learned in cooking class.\n  - Evan: Evan told Sam he is in love with a woman from Canada, whom he married, and expressed joy from viewing a painting that helped him recognize his feelings.\n  - Evan: Evan congratulated Sam on becoming a Weight Watchers coach. Evan shared a picture taken last Friday at a favorite beach spot where he watches waves and sunsets to find peace.\n  - Evan: Evan told Sam that his partner was not thrilled but understood an accident involving rose bushes; he plans to be more careful and enjoys small moments outdoors.\n  - Sam: Sam congratulated Evan, asked if a woman mentioned was from Canada, and commented that art is amazing at expressing emotions.\n  - Evan: Evan told his extended family about his marriage and plans to try poutine in Canada next month. He told Sam he had too much to drink last night and did something regrettable involving roses.\n  - Sam: Sam is trying to keep up with a new health routine despite feeling pressured, and is planning a hike with Evan.\n  - Evan: Evan plans to go on a hike with Sam soon. He recently returned from a morning walk, which he finds helps start the day actively.\n  - Evan: Evan told Sam he is in love with a woman, possibly from Canada, and they did not marry sooner.\n  - Sam: Sam congratulated Evan on his relationship and asked if he believes in love at first sight after learning Evan was in love with the woman from Canada at first sight.\n  - Evan: Evan's partner was not thrilled but understood an accident involving rose bushes; he was also encouraged by Sam about controlling dreams.\n  - Evan: Evan is trying new recipes to stay busy and creative, and recently started taking painting classes. Evan is also making changes to live healthier.\n  - Sam: Sam took friends on a hiking trip last Friday and is interested in healthy snacks, while also expressing concern for Evan after an accident.\n  - Sam: Sam congratulated Evan on the exciting news that Evan's partner is pregnant, expressing enthusiasm for parenthood.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with rough health issues, feeling weighed down but trying to stay positive. Sam discussed health and rose bush news with Evan.\n  - Evan: Evan greeted Sam, mentioned taking the Prius for a mountain drive last weekend, and was in a minor accident on the way back. He also shared he got married last week.\n  - model: Sam commented that an unmentioned model looks vintage and cool and ask