ucation is one of John's main focuses. (event_time: 2022-12-17T11:01:00Z)\n  - John cares about making a real impact regarding education. (event_time: 2023-04-18T19:34:00Z)\n  - John believes there needs to be way better education. (event_time: 2023-04-18T19:34:00Z)\n  - John is looking to find assistance for the kids. (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:43:00Z)\n  - The photo John shared is from a vacation. (event_time: 2023-06-16T19:20:00Z)\n  - Maria comments that the photo John shared is powerful. (event_time: 2023-08-09T20:06:00Z)\n  - John observed how a lack of resources at the school affects the kids' dreams. (event_time: 2023-04-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - John shared a photo of volunteers at a recent event. (event_time: 2023-02-05T14:33:00Z)\n  - John is the one who provided the photos. (event_time: 2023-08-11T00:10:00Z)\n  - John did something good to help the community. (event_time: 2023-08-16T11:08:00Z)\n  - John recently focused on education reform. (event_time: 2023-04-18T19:34:00Z)\n  - John is showing support for helping people in need. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:24:00Z)\n  - John is passionate about improving education in the community. (event_time: 2022-12-17T11:01:00Z)\n  - John is helping students as a mentor at the local school since the last conversation. (event_time: 2023-08-13T15:14:00Z)\n  - John participated in a community event to raise money for a good cause. (event_time: 2023-08-05T00:00:00Z)\n  - John believes that little things like the picture can significantly impact how people think, which he shared with Maria. (event_time: 2023-07-05T18:59:00Z)\n  - John raised a ton of canned food for community help. (event_time: 2023-08-16T11:08:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - a school: John believes schools should be funded properly due to seeing the effect of crumbling infrastructure on his neighborhood while growing up; he shared a picture of a school after receiving funding.\n  - extra f